OL,3,AUS drug agency approves breakthrough
OL,4,Atreatment for pancreatic cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Food and Drug Administration has
OL,7,Fapproved a treatment for pancreatic
OL,8,Fcancer that, in clinical trials, nearly
OL,9,Fdoubled the overall survival time for
OL,10,Fpatients.
OL,12,FThe drug, daraxonrasib, sold under the
OL,13,Fbrand name Rasonque and manufactured by
OL,14,FRevolution Medicines, appears to be a
OL,15,Fbreakthrough in treating one of the
OL,16,Fworld's deadliest cancers.
OL,18,FA late-stage clinical trial with 500
OL,19,Fpatients found those who took the daily
OL,20,Fpill had an average survival time of
OL,21,F13.2 months, compared to 6.6 months for
OL,22,Fthose on chemotherapy.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
