OL,3,AUS drug agency approves breakthrough
OL,4,Atreatment for pancreatic cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FDA said the drug provided a
OL,7,F"critical new option for patients
OL,8,Ffacing an extraordinarily difficult and
OL,9,Fhistorically hard-to-treat cancer".
